* Realistic Electret Microphone Capsule Model (BCM9767)
* Pin 1: OUT / Power (Positive Terminal connected to R1 bias)
* Pin 2: GND (Shield / Case Terminal)
.subckt BCM9767 1 2

* Internal JFET drain resistance (typical 2.2k impedance)
R_MIC 1 N_INT 2.2k

* Acoustic generator:
* 10m = Whisper / Quiet room (20 mVpp open circuit)
* 25m = Normal conversational voice (50 mVpp open circuit)  <-- RECOMMENDED DEFAULT
* 50m = Loud voice / Close speaking (100 mVpp open circuit)
V_ACOUSTIC N_INT 2 DC 0 AC 1 SIN(0 25m {FREQ})

.ends BCM9767
